\date{2026-07-17T12:33:45Z}
\tag{discrete}
\taxon{Remark}

\import{discrete-macros}

\p{It turns out that given only #{C}, #{e}, and #{n}, it is (as far as we know) very difficult to find an #{M} such that #{M^e \equiv_n C}. So no one can read the encrypted message #{C} even if they know the public key #{(e,n)} that was used to encrypt it.}

